authoring_notes = "Step 7C S005 approved Chapter 0 confrontation scene. This scene frames and hands off the fixed final Broken Convoy encounter: Cyanis + Ilyra versus the Level 4 Convoy War-Sorcerer at 70% HP and Level 3 injured Iron Cohort Soldier at 50% HP. War-Sorcerer Rift Lance Preparation remains prohibited before Round 2. The one-time incomplete protective-response state carries for its approved three rounds (+20 Total Defense; first eligible hostile direct action received by each party member deals 20% less eligible damage). This state is not player-facing, does not identify the Card, does not unlock a selectable Card command, and does not refresh. Defeating the War-Sorcerer ends the encounter; the injured Soldier withdraws if still active. S006 owns aftermath, roster closure, and next-route consequences. No dialogue choice architecture."
